    "OpenAPI is partial and illustrative; normalized input is the union of SDK models, SDK routes and published documentation.",
    "Onboarding uses origin-relative /auth routes; API-key management uses /api/v1 and explicit L1 signature headers, as defined by the pinned SDK.",
